WEBVTT

01:37.590 --> 01:42.979
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.580 --> 01:45.930
[Episode 10]

01:46.009 --> 01:48.530
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

02:01.400 --> 02:02.280
Master.

02:04.350 --> 02:06.350
Please save Zhengjun.

02:07.070 --> 02:08.190
Concubine Mei.

02:08.669 --> 02:10.990
[Jingmu Hall]

02:09.360 --> 02:11.150
You failed to raise your son properly
and indulged him

02:11.150 --> 02:14.630
to the point where he made such a grave mistake
that implicated the whole family.

02:14.630 --> 02:17.230
How do you still have the nerve
to plead for him?

02:22.470 --> 02:23.630
Master.

02:25.070 --> 02:27.130
We haven't seen each other for years.

02:27.430 --> 02:31.470
Zhengjun and I have been missing you
day and night.

02:31.470 --> 02:34.590
Zhengjun is your own flesh and blood!

02:35.750 --> 02:37.840
If anything happens to him,

02:38.800 --> 02:41.400
I won't be able to live either!

02:43.310 --> 02:45.280
Master!

03:24.170 --> 03:26.540
[Xie Shu, Army Inspector of the Northern Frontier,
Right Senior Attendant]

03:28.120 --> 03:29.560
You are...

03:31.840 --> 03:32.750
Father.

03:36.710 --> 03:37.800
I am Qingyuan.

03:45.560 --> 03:54.710
Being urged along,
with little time to bathe and groom.

04:02.560 --> 04:03.750
Mother!

04:12.030 --> 04:13.030
Chunqing.

04:16.510 --> 04:18.310
There's no turning back for me.

04:20.390 --> 04:21.320
In the next life,

04:22.800 --> 04:24.730
let's keep being husband and wife.

04:41.750 --> 04:42.560
Alike.

04:44.150 --> 04:45.240
Too alike.

04:46.950 --> 04:48.810
You look so much like your mother.

04:57.830 --> 04:58.720
Father!

04:59.310 --> 05:00.040
Father!

05:00.920 --> 05:01.680
Father!

05:03.070 --> 05:04.000
You're finally back!

05:04.000 --> 05:05.260
Did you bring me a gift?

05:05.800 --> 05:06.270
Father,

05:06.270 --> 05:08.000
do our new clothes look nice?

05:08.120 --> 05:08.750
Yes.

05:09.240 --> 05:10.040
You've grown taller.

05:10.040 --> 05:11.630
-Jingzhi.
-You look prettier.

05:11.630 --> 05:12.830
-Mother.
-Thank you, father.

05:12.830 --> 05:14.290
-Mother is here!
-Mother.

05:16.310 --> 05:17.440
Greetings, Master.

05:18.480 --> 05:19.360
Madam,

05:20.070 --> 05:21.670
thank you for your hard work.

05:22.480 --> 05:23.040
Father,

05:23.160 --> 05:23.950
you said

05:23.950 --> 05:26.720
you'd buy me a kite
as soon as you came back.

05:27.390 --> 05:29.000
How old are you?

05:36.150 --> 05:37.720
Finally, you're back,

05:38.800 --> 05:40.600
murderer.

05:42.510 --> 05:43.360
Mother,

05:43.920 --> 05:45.830
I've been away for many years

05:45.830 --> 05:47.150
and couldn't fulfill my filial duties.

05:47.150 --> 05:48.270
When you were sick,

05:48.360 --> 05:50.220
I couldn't rush back to serve you.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.830
I have failed as a son.

05:53.070 --> 05:54.130
Please forgive me.

05:55.920 --> 05:57.070
Shu,

05:58.190 --> 05:59.310
get up, quickly.

06:01.160 --> 06:01.950
My son,

06:02.830 --> 06:03.920
look at you.

06:04.560 --> 06:06.240
Why are you so haggard?

06:08.360 --> 06:10.820
Even if you were busy
with military affairs,

06:11.190 --> 06:13.650
you should have
taken good care of yourself.

06:14.270 --> 06:15.360
I heard

06:15.950 --> 06:18.240
your back injury flared up again.

06:18.510 --> 06:20.040
Are you feeling better now?

06:21.720 --> 06:23.380
I've been fine for a long time.

06:23.630 --> 06:24.360
Good.

06:24.750 --> 06:26.120
Good then.

06:28.480 --> 06:29.540
Where is Zhenglun?

06:30.630 --> 06:32.000
That boy has some...

06:32.150 --> 06:33.120
trivial things to take care of.

06:33.120 --> 06:34.240
He'll be back later.

06:34.240 --> 06:35.120
Don't worry.

06:36.430 --> 06:37.240
Father,

06:37.240 --> 06:39.310
you haven't answered my question yet.

06:39.310 --> 06:41.310
What gift did you bring me this time?

06:41.390 --> 06:42.750
You are a big girl now,

06:42.750 --> 06:44.630
and you are still
asking your father for gifts?

06:44.630 --> 06:45.560
There are gifts.

06:46.120 --> 06:47.720
I have gifts for all of you.

06:48.480 --> 06:50.280
All these years while I was away,

06:51.000 --> 06:52.600
if you've made progress,

06:53.000 --> 06:55.060
I have plenty of nice rewards for you.

06:56.190 --> 06:57.560
But for those

06:57.920 --> 06:59.720
who have been naughty, like you,

06:59.720 --> 07:01.520
I've prepared a big punishment.

07:02.390 --> 07:03.720
She deserves a beating.

07:14.190 --> 07:16.270
During the time you were away,

07:16.920 --> 07:18.070
Lady Prefect

07:18.750 --> 07:20.070
helped our residence

07:20.480 --> 07:22.000
make a great match.

07:23.160 --> 07:24.360
She betrothed Qinghe

07:24.720 --> 07:25.870
to

07:26.270 --> 07:28.600
the legitimate son of the Founding Count.

07:28.950 --> 07:31.560
This is an excellent match.

07:32.000 --> 07:33.720
May our ancestors bless us.

07:34.240 --> 07:35.150
In the future,

07:35.680 --> 07:38.750
if all the younger generation
in our family

07:39.070 --> 07:40.830
make something of themselves,

07:41.190 --> 07:42.720
when I go to the underworld,

07:42.870 --> 07:45.120
I'll be able to answer to your father.

07:46.070 --> 07:47.240
Mother,

07:47.360 --> 07:49.270
what are you saying?

07:49.720 --> 07:51.600
I know about these things.

07:52.120 --> 07:53.250
Have you forgotten?

07:53.510 --> 07:54.770
I received your letter

07:54.950 --> 07:56.310
a long time ago.

07:56.720 --> 07:57.480
It's just that

07:57.480 --> 07:58.830
I came back

07:59.040 --> 08:00.440
before my reply arrived.

08:05.430 --> 08:07.230
During the years I've been away,

08:07.430 --> 08:09.000
our residence has been well managed

08:09.000 --> 08:10.560
thanks to Madam Hu.

08:11.040 --> 08:13.070
She has led everyone
with tireless devotion,

08:13.070 --> 08:14.310
lived frugally,

08:14.600 --> 08:16.720
shown filial devotion,

08:17.720 --> 08:19.040
upheld her duties as a wife,

08:19.040 --> 08:23.240
and kept the entire household
running like clockwork.

08:24.360 --> 08:25.430
Honey,

08:26.270 --> 08:27.870
thank you for your hard work.

08:35.200 --> 08:36.480
Concubine Lian.

08:36.870 --> 08:38.530
You have been gentle and kind,

08:38.750 --> 08:40.870
kept harmony throughout the household,

08:40.870 --> 08:41.840
and always

08:42.440 --> 08:46.270
put the interests of the Xie family first.

08:46.840 --> 08:48.080
This marriage

08:48.840 --> 08:50.600
is a great match.

08:55.390 --> 08:56.240
Qinghe.

08:58.390 --> 09:01.030
Are you satisfied with your marriage?

09:04.320 --> 09:05.200
Son,

09:06.120 --> 09:09.270
I believe you are aware of

09:09.790 --> 09:13.790
why Yan Rui surrounded our residence.

09:14.240 --> 09:15.870
Our family was

09:16.080 --> 09:17.600
extremely careful,

09:17.750 --> 09:20.630
but we still fell into his trap.

09:23.600 --> 09:24.360
Yan Rui

09:25.120 --> 09:26.790
is just a brat,

09:27.630 --> 09:28.890
not worth mentioning.

09:29.000 --> 09:30.200
Don't worry, Mother.

09:32.030 --> 09:33.630
Lord Yan has arrived!

09:39.390 --> 09:41.080
He came so quickly.

10:02.600 --> 10:03.550
Lord Xie.

10:15.750 --> 10:17.950
In all these years at the Xie Residence,

10:18.080 --> 10:20.000
you are the first one

10:20.510 --> 10:22.240
to barge into the hall

10:23.200 --> 10:24.720
uninvited.

10:28.200 --> 10:29.670
You must be...

10:29.960 --> 10:31.120
Lord Yan.

10:31.670 --> 10:32.750
I am.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.550
Nice to meet you.

10:37.360 --> 10:39.150
Lord Xie, you are a busy man.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.200
Today,

10:40.480 --> 10:42.410
we finally have the chance to meet.

10:46.790 --> 10:47.870
Lord Yan,

10:48.440 --> 10:51.390
you concern yourself with everything,

10:51.630 --> 10:53.510
from matters of state to civil affairs.

10:53.510 --> 10:54.770
I didn't expect myself

10:55.000 --> 10:57.480
to be on your list of concerns as well.

10:58.030 --> 10:59.870
You sure do work hard.

11:00.910 --> 11:01.910
Thank you.

11:02.960 --> 11:03.910
Lord Yan,

11:04.440 --> 11:06.080
my son just arrived,

11:06.480 --> 11:08.150
and you already got the news.

11:08.480 --> 11:12.390
You really have eyes everywhere.

11:13.960 --> 11:16.220
Thank you for the compliment, Old Madam.

11:17.670 --> 11:18.840
Lord Xie

11:19.030 --> 11:21.090
is an important minister of the court

11:21.200 --> 11:22.930
with heavy responsibilities.

11:23.000 --> 11:25.030
I should naturally care about him.

11:30.120 --> 11:31.510
I heard my son

11:31.750 --> 11:33.600
is involved in

11:34.030 --> 11:38.360
some case regarding disaster relief grain.

11:38.630 --> 11:41.150
Is the evidence complete now?

11:41.510 --> 11:42.910
Rest assured, Lord Xie.

11:43.360 --> 11:45.720
I will handle it impartially.

11:46.200 --> 11:46.750
Yes.

11:47.240 --> 11:49.040
It must be handled impartially.

11:53.720 --> 11:56.720
Then may I see my son?

11:56.960 --> 11:57.670
Of course.

11:58.120 --> 11:59.720
Whenever you want to see him,

11:59.720 --> 12:00.960
you may see him.

12:01.150 --> 12:02.550
I will be waiting for you.

12:04.200 --> 12:05.840
Lord Yan, you're merciful.

12:07.150 --> 12:07.790
Thank you.

12:15.360 --> 12:16.960
What are you laughing about?

12:17.000 --> 12:19.000
The unpredictability of the world.

12:20.120 --> 12:21.480
Do you remember

12:21.870 --> 12:24.670
when I said we have a long future ahead?

12:26.390 --> 12:27.120
My Lord.

12:28.120 --> 12:29.360
Must you

12:30.240 --> 12:31.480
continue this act?

12:32.440 --> 12:33.150
With an honored guest here,

12:33.150 --> 12:34.600
I naturally must continue.

12:34.600 --> 12:35.150
What?

12:35.720 --> 12:37.510
Your iron will

12:37.840 --> 12:39.120
has finally softened,

12:39.390 --> 12:41.050
and you've changed your mind?

12:50.720 --> 12:51.390
See?

12:53.440 --> 12:54.510
What I can give you

12:55.240 --> 12:56.500
is much more than this.

12:58.670 --> 13:00.080
My Lord, what I want

13:00.870 --> 13:02.400
is also much more than this.

13:07.380 --> 13:11.320
♪ I counted every moment ♪

13:07.670 --> 13:09.510
I hope that this time,

13:10.630 --> 13:11.910
you mean it.

13:11.340 --> 13:15.430
♪ Memories took root ♪

13:15.450 --> 13:19.970
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

13:16.910 --> 13:17.870
The same to you.

13:20.000 --> 13:24.570
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

13:21.000 --> 13:22.240
I also hope that

13:23.200 --> 13:24.670
you mean it.

13:25.090 --> 13:28.930
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

13:28.510 --> 13:29.840
Compared to East Pearls,

13:28.950 --> 13:33.160
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

13:30.510 --> 13:31.910
it seems you prefer jade.

13:33.180 --> 13:39.610
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

13:40.090 --> 13:43.710
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

13:41.870 --> 13:43.530
Allow me to kindly remind you.

13:43.740 --> 13:49.250
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

13:46.360 --> 13:49.000
Once hands holding a knife
are stained with blood,

13:49.000 --> 13:50.390
they can never be washed clean.

13:49.280 --> 13:53.840
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

13:53.860 --> 13:58.040
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

13:58.070 --> 14:02.640
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

14:00.630 --> 14:02.440
As long as my blade has a target,

14:02.660 --> 14:07.000
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

14:03.550 --> 14:05.010
even a mountain of corpses

14:07.030 --> 14:11.390
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

14:07.320 --> 14:08.480
and a sea of blood

14:09.790 --> 14:11.030
mean nothing to me.

14:11.420 --> 14:15.820
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

14:15.840 --> 14:21.630
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

14:39.320 --> 14:41.600
Father, save me! Father!

14:42.360 --> 14:44.000
I don't know anything, Father!

14:44.000 --> 14:45.270
My Lord. My Lord. My Lord.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.200
My Lord. My Lord.

14:47.320 --> 14:48.080
My Lord!

14:48.390 --> 14:49.360
You animal!

14:50.910 --> 14:51.370
My Lord!

14:51.510 --> 14:53.630
How dare you lay a hand
on the relief grain?

14:53.630 --> 14:55.030
Who did you collude with?

14:55.270 --> 14:56.390
How much did you embezzle?

14:56.390 --> 14:58.000
Tell me everything!

14:58.000 --> 14:58.550
Father!

14:58.750 --> 15:00.550
I didn't know it was the relief grain!

15:00.550 --> 15:02.440
Guo Baofeng asked me
to transport the grain,

15:02.440 --> 15:03.390
saying it could make money.

15:03.390 --> 15:05.450
If I had known it was the relief grain,

15:05.510 --> 15:07.240
I definitely wouldn't have dared to do it!

15:07.240 --> 15:08.840
Father, please trust me!

15:08.840 --> 15:09.910
Nonsense!

15:10.670 --> 15:11.910
Trust me!

15:11.960 --> 15:12.480
My Lord!

15:12.840 --> 15:14.200
Leave me alone!

15:14.870 --> 15:16.130
None of you interfere.

15:16.510 --> 15:18.120
Before asking any questions,

15:18.120 --> 15:19.180
torture him first.

15:19.510 --> 15:20.720
Bring the whip!

15:20.840 --> 15:21.440
Whip him!

15:21.550 --> 15:22.360
Father!

15:31.200 --> 15:32.060
That's enough.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.000
Stop.

15:33.870 --> 15:34.510
No.

15:34.960 --> 15:36.480
Don't stop until he

15:37.270 --> 15:38.130
gets 70 lashes!

15:38.320 --> 15:39.360
Father!

15:41.120 --> 15:42.580
If a prince breaks the law,

15:43.120 --> 15:44.850
he is punished like a commoner.

15:45.360 --> 15:49.200
-If this brat really did all this,
-Father!

15:49.200 --> 15:50.750
I will kill him myself!

15:55.150 --> 15:56.010
That's enough.

15:56.440 --> 15:57.030
Stop.

16:02.630 --> 16:04.430
Then I will be straightforward.

16:05.840 --> 16:08.150
I believe your son is innocent.

16:08.790 --> 16:11.250
However, I really don't know
how to deal with

16:11.440 --> 16:13.040
the mastermind behind this.

16:13.270 --> 16:14.360
As you know,

16:15.200 --> 16:18.240
I've been looking for the ledger
from the corruption case.

16:18.240 --> 16:20.600
And I believe it's now

16:21.270 --> 16:22.630
in your residence.

16:24.910 --> 16:27.110
After all, it involves too many people,

16:27.320 --> 16:28.910
including the Xie family.

16:30.080 --> 16:31.280
It's a tricky matter.

16:31.960 --> 16:32.720
Lord Yan,

16:34.360 --> 16:36.790
you must not bend the law

16:37.120 --> 16:38.720
out of consideration for me.

16:38.870 --> 16:39.910
If it is proven

16:40.790 --> 16:43.150
that it really was my son's doing,

16:43.750 --> 16:47.320
you must deal with him severely
according to the law.

16:48.360 --> 16:51.090
I'm handing over
the entire Xie household to you,

16:51.670 --> 16:53.330
and I will have no complaints.

16:56.790 --> 16:57.630
Lord Xie,

16:58.510 --> 17:00.270
as you can see,

17:01.720 --> 17:03.910
Wei Changyan supervises Hengtang

17:04.160 --> 17:06.200
and has been entrenched here
for a long time.

17:06.200 --> 17:08.800
Although this time,
I came by imperial decree,

17:09.030 --> 17:12.109
it is inconvenient for me
to deal with a local tyrant.

17:12.720 --> 17:14.520
But Lord Xie, you are different.

17:14.790 --> 17:17.829
The Xie family
is a prestigious family in Hengtang

17:18.109 --> 17:19.770
with extensive connections.

17:20.000 --> 17:21.109
I believe only you

17:21.480 --> 17:23.010
can help me with this favor.

17:23.750 --> 17:24.400
My Lord,

17:25.030 --> 17:25.960
think about it.

17:32.310 --> 17:34.510
After all, if I don't catch the culprit,

17:34.830 --> 17:37.240
I can't release your son either.

17:38.110 --> 17:39.160
Say no more.

17:40.240 --> 17:41.070
I understand.

17:42.830 --> 17:44.480
Wei Changyan

17:45.110 --> 17:46.750
is indeed a tricky one.

17:47.200 --> 17:49.060
But please do not worry, Lord Yan.

17:49.350 --> 17:51.550
No matter how complicated the world is,

17:51.830 --> 17:53.830
nothing can ever override justice.

17:54.640 --> 17:56.370
If a person commits evil deeds,

17:56.680 --> 17:58.550
no matter how powerful

17:58.750 --> 18:00.270
or well-connected they are,

18:00.270 --> 18:02.550
I only believe in one principle—

18:03.110 --> 18:05.310
good and evil will always be rewarded.

18:06.070 --> 18:06.960
Ultimately,

18:07.510 --> 18:09.370
evil can never prevail over good.

18:25.960 --> 18:26.480
Father.

18:44.030 --> 18:45.090
What's the matter?

18:46.790 --> 18:49.200
I want to talk to you, Father.

19:01.400 --> 19:03.200
What are you looking at, Father?

19:05.240 --> 19:06.750
When I first saw you,

19:08.160 --> 19:10.270
I thought you looked like your mother.

19:10.270 --> 19:11.930
But now, the more I look at you,

19:14.200 --> 19:16.000
the more I think you look like me.

19:22.270 --> 19:24.680
The past is unbearable to recall.

19:27.070 --> 19:28.070
It is only natural

19:29.200 --> 19:31.330
for a daughter to look like her father.

19:34.480 --> 19:36.140
I just want to ask you, Father,

19:36.830 --> 19:39.510
what kind of person was my mother?

19:43.920 --> 19:46.830
You were with your mother since childhood.

19:49.310 --> 19:51.310
You should know her better than I do.

19:53.590 --> 19:55.000
Why are you asking me?

20:01.160 --> 20:02.550
When I was young,

20:03.240 --> 20:04.700
I once fell seriously ill,

20:04.790 --> 20:06.320
with a high fever for 7 days.

20:06.720 --> 20:07.880
After I woke up,

20:08.480 --> 20:10.340
I couldn't remember many things.

20:11.110 --> 20:12.920
Even what my mother looked like

20:14.160 --> 20:15.310
is a bit blurry.

20:18.030 --> 20:19.550
When did you get sick?

20:23.200 --> 20:24.660
How could it be so serious?

20:33.160 --> 20:34.440
It must have been...

20:35.070 --> 20:37.670
after I parted with my mother
for the last time.

20:38.750 --> 20:40.400
I don't remember clearly.

20:41.480 --> 20:43.010
Whenever I try to recall it,

20:44.880 --> 20:46.160
my head aches.

20:50.270 --> 20:51.070
Father,

20:52.400 --> 20:53.590
I am unfilial.

20:53.920 --> 20:55.200
I let Mother down.

20:55.440 --> 20:57.400
So I hope you don't mind me asking

20:58.270 --> 20:59.330
what kind of person

20:59.720 --> 21:01.240
my mother was.

21:16.270 --> 21:17.310
Good child.

21:24.830 --> 21:25.790
Come with me.

21:44.750 --> 21:48.010
It was around the time
of the first spring thunder that year

21:49.590 --> 21:52.750
that I first saw your mother
at an entertainment house in Lin'an.

21:52.750 --> 21:54.810
She was singing The Story of the Lute.

21:55.240 --> 21:56.840
Her long sleeves fluttered,

21:57.160 --> 21:58.640
just like a butterfly.

21:59.680 --> 22:01.830
She laughed
at Cai Bojie's foolish filial piety,

22:01.830 --> 22:04.200
abandoning his newly-wedded wife
for an official position.

22:04.200 --> 22:07.480
But when I was studying for
the imperial examination, she advised me,

22:07.480 --> 22:10.110
"An official position
is the most important thing to you.

22:10.110 --> 22:13.350
You must not let me
hold you back from your future.

22:14.790 --> 22:16.030
Through severe winters and hot summers,

22:16.030 --> 22:17.400
even if the seas run dry
and the rocks crumble,

22:17.400 --> 22:18.460
I will wait for you.

22:19.240 --> 22:20.700
Wait for you to come home."

22:21.440 --> 22:24.920
Later, I thought of many ways.

22:26.590 --> 22:28.510
That Fifth Madam of yours

22:29.110 --> 22:32.720
was the niece
of Eunuch Xia in the capital.

22:32.600 --> 22:34.820
[Jingmu Hall]

22:33.030 --> 22:34.900
They are of great power.

22:35.590 --> 22:37.440
The Xia family gave the word

22:37.750 --> 22:39.280
to have your mother killed.

22:40.750 --> 22:43.410
If I hadn't let your mother
leave the residence,

22:43.590 --> 22:45.990
we wouldn't have been able
to save her life.

22:47.960 --> 22:49.240
But if I had known

22:50.440 --> 22:53.170
that your mother
was carrying my flesh and blood,

22:53.440 --> 22:55.720
I would have fought for her
no matter what,

22:55.720 --> 22:56.830
just as I fought

22:57.270 --> 23:00.350
to marry her back then.

23:11.440 --> 23:12.160
Father,

23:13.590 --> 23:14.850
was this the first time

23:15.680 --> 23:17.480
you fought for a woman?

23:19.830 --> 23:20.550
Of course.

23:22.000 --> 23:23.400
It was also the last time.

23:24.270 --> 23:25.350
The only time.

23:30.440 --> 23:33.440
The waters run deep
in the households of the powerful.

23:34.270 --> 23:35.270
In the Xie family,

23:35.790 --> 23:38.030
my marriages
to my wife and my 4 concubines

23:38.030 --> 23:40.000
were all alliances forged

23:40.310 --> 23:41.590
for power, influence,

23:42.000 --> 23:43.750
or wealth.

23:44.640 --> 23:45.830
The only one

23:46.550 --> 23:48.310
I truly considered my wife

23:52.850 --> 23:54.110
[Danyue Pavilion]

23:57.550 --> 23:59.080
was your mother, Chunqing.

24:03.720 --> 24:04.720
Chunqing...

24:06.350 --> 24:08.160
There's no turning back for me.

24:09.680 --> 24:10.610
In the next life,

24:11.550 --> 24:13.480
let's keep being husband and wife.

24:23.440 --> 24:24.240
Do you,

24:25.400 --> 24:26.590
like everyone else,

24:28.200 --> 24:29.110
think my mother

24:29.830 --> 24:30.960
was a murderer,

24:31.680 --> 24:32.790
and that's why

24:33.510 --> 24:35.440
you never cared about the two of us?

24:36.030 --> 24:37.240
How is that possible?

24:39.960 --> 24:43.110
But the evidence was conclusive,

24:43.550 --> 24:45.480
and Cui'er testified against her.

24:45.680 --> 24:47.540
I couldn't say I don't believe it.

24:49.160 --> 24:51.160
I never visited you two

24:52.270 --> 24:53.200
for fear that

24:53.510 --> 24:55.400
any clues

24:55.830 --> 24:57.030
would be discovered,

24:57.270 --> 24:58.930
which would bring harm to you.

25:00.160 --> 25:00.960
Later,

25:01.110 --> 25:02.400
when that thing happened to your mother,

25:02.400 --> 25:05.260
I searched all over Jiangnan
but couldn't find you.

25:05.550 --> 25:07.110
I didn't expect you

25:07.550 --> 25:09.080
to be in Hengtang all along.

25:12.350 --> 25:13.160
My daughter,

25:14.070 --> 25:15.400
you have suffered a lot.

25:17.240 --> 25:18.750
I will show you something.

25:28.200 --> 25:29.890
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

25:29.910 --> 25:32.090
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

25:30.590 --> 25:31.640
That year,

25:32.790 --> 25:35.450
I went to the capital
to take up my official post.

25:36.400 --> 25:37.720
Before I left,

25:38.270 --> 25:40.510
your mother and I
lived in perfect harmony,

25:40.510 --> 25:42.240
and composed poetry together.

25:43.070 --> 25:45.000
This is what we wrote together.

25:46.070 --> 25:47.780
The words "Spring of The Blade"

25:47.780 --> 25:49.640
[Spring of The Blade]

25:48.350 --> 25:50.680
were written by your mother Chunqing.

25:53.640 --> 25:54.350
Great!

25:56.450 --> 25:57.370
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

25:57.400 --> 25:58.560
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

26:01.110 --> 26:02.440
I took my official post

26:03.240 --> 26:04.770
and was about to return home

26:05.200 --> 26:09.070
when Eunuch Xia took a fancy to me.

26:09.830 --> 26:12.550
He forced me to marry his niece,

26:12.550 --> 26:13.790
Xia Yingying.

26:14.720 --> 26:16.580
Xia Yingying was a jealous woman.

26:16.590 --> 26:18.510
You know the rest.

26:21.550 --> 26:22.510
Eventually,

26:23.240 --> 26:25.900
she forced your mother
out of the Xie Residence.

26:27.240 --> 26:30.720
From then on, I wept every day,

26:31.350 --> 26:34.410
and could only
secretly look at this scroll every night

26:34.440 --> 26:35.900
to ease my longing for her.

26:37.350 --> 26:38.290
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

26:38.310 --> 26:39.760
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

26:38.480 --> 26:39.350
The blood...

26:48.900 --> 26:50.480
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

26:50.500 --> 26:52.290
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

26:59.860 --> 27:02.480
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

27:02.500 --> 27:06.250
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

27:06.830 --> 27:07.830
It's fine.

27:10.110 --> 27:11.110
For this illness,

27:12.720 --> 27:15.960
many people hired doctors for me

27:16.830 --> 27:19.090
but I secretly poured the medicine away.

27:20.640 --> 27:21.970
I don't want to be cured.

27:25.070 --> 27:26.600
I want to keep this illness.

27:27.200 --> 27:28.510
It brings me comfort.

27:30.750 --> 27:32.790
My longing became an illness.

27:33.200 --> 27:34.730
This is the only connection

27:35.240 --> 27:38.200
left by Heaven in my bones

27:38.960 --> 27:43.680
that will forever tie me to your mother.

27:46.920 --> 27:48.120
I will take it with me.

27:56.800 --> 28:02.000
[Danyue Pavilion]

28:22.400 --> 28:24.380
[Danyue Pavilion]

28:22.590 --> 28:23.440
My Lady.

28:35.680 --> 28:36.480
Baoxian.

28:39.510 --> 28:40.510
I was...

28:42.720 --> 28:43.590
so close...

28:46.830 --> 28:48.310
to killing him just now.

28:50.750 --> 28:52.750
With just a slight lift of my hand,

28:55.110 --> 28:56.840
I could have stabbed this knife

28:57.510 --> 28:59.880
into his heart without hesitation.

29:07.720 --> 29:09.240
But I held back.

29:19.960 --> 29:21.110
I watched

29:22.550 --> 29:23.880
this hypocrite

29:24.510 --> 29:27.270
play the role of

29:29.200 --> 29:31.460
a husband who deeply loved his late wife,

29:33.550 --> 29:35.110
a father who was

29:36.480 --> 29:38.740
full of remorse in front of his daughter.

29:40.720 --> 29:41.350
Daughter.

29:43.720 --> 29:44.550
You know,

29:45.400 --> 29:46.790
when I was younger,

29:47.590 --> 29:49.260
I often had this foolish dream.

29:49.260 --> 29:50.320
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

29:50.270 --> 29:53.200
It has to be after a harsh winter,

29:50.350 --> 29:51.460
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

29:54.480 --> 29:56.480
when the snow has cleared
and spring has brought clear skies.

29:56.480 --> 29:59.030
With a fine steed and an elegant carriage,

29:59.790 --> 30:02.240
I bring your mother back home as my bride.

30:02.920 --> 30:04.720
But that very year,

30:06.110 --> 30:07.310
just as spring began,

30:08.030 --> 30:10.030
before the last snow cleared,

30:10.310 --> 30:15.270
I heard that your mother had died
for harboring rebels.

30:23.110 --> 30:24.030
Since then...

30:28.590 --> 30:29.640
Since then,

30:30.440 --> 30:32.240
around the beginning of spring,

30:32.920 --> 30:35.880
I would lock myself away to reflect,

30:36.400 --> 30:37.730
refusing to see anyone.

30:38.240 --> 30:39.000
Because...

30:41.880 --> 30:43.880
Because from then on, in this world,

30:45.590 --> 30:46.720
there was no spring.

30:48.680 --> 30:50.480
His act was so convincing,

30:52.720 --> 30:54.240
so disgusting.

30:54.720 --> 30:56.850
The only wife I acknowledge in my heart

30:57.160 --> 30:58.620
is your mother, Chunqing.

30:59.880 --> 31:01.680
You've already done very well.

31:03.400 --> 31:05.160
Patience will surely pay off.

31:05.480 --> 31:06.160
Our goal

31:06.160 --> 31:07.640
isn't to let him die so easily,

31:07.640 --> 31:08.270
right?

31:09.350 --> 31:11.030
He must pay a higher price.

31:11.680 --> 31:13.120
[Danyue Pavilion]

31:15.110 --> 31:16.680
But I'm in so much pain!

31:19.590 --> 31:21.320
If it weren't for him back then,

31:21.590 --> 31:23.190
how could my mother have died

31:23.200 --> 31:24.480
so miserably?

31:24.960 --> 31:27.020
Yet I still have to play along with him

31:27.200 --> 31:28.310
and put on

31:28.750 --> 31:31.950
this disgusting act
of deep father-daughter affection.

31:32.160 --> 31:33.750
I'm really in so much pain!

31:34.510 --> 31:35.550
From then on,

31:36.350 --> 31:37.920
I wept every day,

31:38.640 --> 31:41.700
and could only
secretly look at this scroll every night

31:41.720 --> 31:43.180
to ease my longing for her.

31:45.310 --> 31:46.070
His act

31:47.720 --> 31:49.000
just now

31:49.590 --> 31:52.790
made me realize
that no one in this residence is innocent.

31:52.880 --> 31:53.590
Father,

31:55.030 --> 31:56.400
was this the first time

31:57.200 --> 31:59.000
you fought for a woman?

32:01.270 --> 32:02.070
Of course.

32:03.440 --> 32:04.840
It was also the last time.

32:05.720 --> 32:06.720
The only time.

32:08.790 --> 32:10.790
I will find out everyone

32:11.720 --> 32:13.000
involved in

32:14.880 --> 32:16.680
hurting my mother back then.

32:19.200 --> 32:21.070
I want them all to receive

32:22.680 --> 32:24.400
the punishment they deserve.

32:24.880 --> 32:26.350
Alright, we'll find them.

32:27.350 --> 32:28.880
We will find them together.

32:30.000 --> 32:30.790
My Lady,

32:32.200 --> 32:34.030
you are the bravest

32:34.310 --> 32:36.710
and most incredible daughter in the world.

32:36.830 --> 32:39.000
I think you've done very well.

32:42.000 --> 32:42.640
No.

32:48.510 --> 32:49.440
It's not enough.

32:51.680 --> 32:52.480
My mother

32:53.750 --> 32:56.310
is still being accused of murder.

32:58.880 --> 32:59.960
The only way

33:01.720 --> 33:04.050
is to find the only witness
from that year,

33:04.790 --> 33:06.390
Cui'er, the medicine slave.

33:08.640 --> 33:10.510
Fifth Madam died of the euphorbia,

33:10.510 --> 33:12.110
and Cui'er has gone missing.

33:12.440 --> 33:14.570
Where should we start investigating?

33:16.680 --> 33:18.410
There will be a way eventually.

33:20.070 --> 33:21.030
Xie Shu,

33:23.510 --> 33:25.240
I want you to live well

33:27.920 --> 33:29.270
and watch helplessly

33:32.350 --> 33:34.400
as I destroy everything you have,

33:36.750 --> 33:38.270
step by step.

33:49.510 --> 33:50.030
Madam.

33:52.400 --> 33:53.200
Bear with it.

33:56.200 --> 33:57.440
Black hair

33:57.750 --> 33:59.030
turning white.

33:59.640 --> 34:01.880
You've been working so hard.

34:02.200 --> 34:04.260
It pains my heart to see you like this.

34:09.800 --> 34:11.280
I must treasure it.

34:19.710 --> 34:21.070
About Zhengjun...

34:21.440 --> 34:22.110
Master,

34:22.630 --> 34:23.840
what is your plan?

34:24.440 --> 34:26.840
He caused such trouble.

34:27.400 --> 34:28.190
I'm afraid

34:29.480 --> 34:31.739
it will implicate our entire Xie family.

34:32.920 --> 34:34.230
That little brat—

34:35.630 --> 34:37.489
you don't need to worry about him.

34:38.670 --> 34:40.320
But right now,

34:40.670 --> 34:42.280
to save the Xie family,

34:43.000 --> 34:45.840
we must do as Yan Rui said

34:46.360 --> 34:48.290
and testify against Wei Changyan.

34:48.840 --> 34:51.280
But he was

34:51.280 --> 34:52.960
personally trained by our older brother.

34:52.960 --> 34:54.360
Given our relationship,

34:54.710 --> 34:57.320
I dare not act ra—

34:59.320 --> 35:00.150
Master.

35:01.550 --> 35:04.150
Since I've married into the Xie family,

35:04.960 --> 35:07.670
I put the Xie family first in everything.

35:08.110 --> 35:11.230
Moreover, my older brother
holds a high position,

35:11.960 --> 35:14.760
so he naturally knows
the dangers of officialdom.

35:14.800 --> 35:17.000
Now that our Xie family is in trouble,

35:17.840 --> 35:20.510
he will surely understand
our difficulties.

35:22.510 --> 35:23.630
I owe him my thanks.

35:25.480 --> 35:26.230
Honey.

35:27.440 --> 35:30.920
There's something I find hard to say,

35:31.440 --> 35:33.840
but I must tell you.

35:34.110 --> 35:36.030
My return this time

35:36.030 --> 35:38.090
is not for recovering from injuries.

35:38.230 --> 35:39.110
It's because

35:41.320 --> 35:44.070
I failed in my supervision
in the Northern Frontier.

35:44.070 --> 35:45.480
The court punished me,

35:45.630 --> 35:47.090
suspended me from my post,

35:47.550 --> 35:48.710
and ordered me back

35:49.760 --> 35:52.000
to reflect on my mistakes
behind closed doors.

35:52.000 --> 35:52.920
I am ashamed.

35:55.190 --> 35:58.760
We already knew about this.

36:00.760 --> 36:01.760
Good.

36:07.000 --> 36:08.510
I'm a fool.

36:08.670 --> 36:10.760
How could anything happening at court

36:10.760 --> 36:12.710
escape Brother's notice?

36:18.190 --> 36:19.110
Master...

36:19.760 --> 36:21.190
Honey, I understand now.

36:22.000 --> 36:23.800
Before, I couldn't figure out

36:24.150 --> 36:26.840
why His Majesty was lenient with me

36:26.840 --> 36:28.510
and gave me a light punishment.

36:28.510 --> 36:29.400
Honey,

36:29.670 --> 36:32.630
did you plead with Brother

36:32.800 --> 36:34.060
many times on my behalf

36:34.920 --> 36:36.710
after you found out about this?

36:39.320 --> 36:40.840
Please accept my bow.

36:42.320 --> 36:43.840
No, no.

36:45.590 --> 36:46.440
Honey.

36:51.190 --> 36:52.190
Get up quickly.

37:01.880 --> 37:02.800
Honey.

37:03.230 --> 37:05.150
With a wife like you,

37:06.000 --> 37:07.860
what more could a husband ask for?

37:10.070 --> 37:14.760
But now that I've lost my power,

37:15.280 --> 37:16.550
that Yan Rui...

37:17.190 --> 37:19.250
He's a close minister to His Majesty.

37:19.320 --> 37:21.400
I can't clash with him head-on.

37:22.840 --> 37:24.840
I'm afraid I can't prevail over him.

37:25.590 --> 37:26.510
Jingzhi.

37:28.030 --> 37:30.760
In Mother's letter to you a few days ago,

37:31.320 --> 37:32.710
did she mention

37:33.000 --> 37:36.590
that Yan Rui seems to have...

37:36.840 --> 37:38.700
a special fondness for Qingyuan?

37:44.230 --> 37:45.150
Let me do it.

37:49.070 --> 37:49.920
Master.

37:50.630 --> 37:52.360
A message came from Liuhua Courtyard
saying

37:52.360 --> 37:54.420
Second Madam is asking you to go over.

37:55.440 --> 37:56.110
Reject it.

37:56.590 --> 37:57.520
Doesn't she know

37:57.960 --> 38:01.280
that I'm spending the night here
with Madam Hu?

38:01.590 --> 38:03.250
Tell her we can talk tomorrow.

38:03.800 --> 38:04.360
Master.

38:05.030 --> 38:06.890
I'm afraid that's not a good idea.

38:10.440 --> 38:11.880
Come inside and report.

38:15.070 --> 38:17.070
What do you mean that's not a good idea?

38:17.070 --> 38:18.470
Second Madam is furious.

38:18.760 --> 38:20.840
She said she would smash up
Liuhua Courtyard.

38:20.840 --> 38:22.100
Is she trying to rebel?

38:22.280 --> 38:23.230
So unruly!

38:27.360 --> 38:28.280
Jingzhi.

38:29.320 --> 38:30.590
You should go over.

38:32.070 --> 38:33.000
How could I?

38:33.630 --> 38:34.320
No.

38:36.360 --> 38:38.840
You scolded her during the day.

38:39.760 --> 38:40.880
What's more,

38:41.190 --> 38:44.230
her favorite youngest son
is still in prison.

38:45.550 --> 38:46.630
She probably

38:48.630 --> 38:50.920
has a lot she wants to tell you.

38:51.400 --> 38:53.320
She's getting way too bold.

38:53.840 --> 38:54.670
Honey,

38:55.190 --> 38:57.150
you are just too lenient.

38:58.320 --> 38:59.550
I regret it.

39:00.230 --> 39:01.150
Honey,

39:01.880 --> 39:04.630
I was forced to marry this witch

39:05.510 --> 39:07.230
back then.

39:07.800 --> 39:10.260
I had no choice,
and I couldn't say anything.

39:11.190 --> 39:12.110
I understand.

39:14.670 --> 39:15.360
No.

39:15.840 --> 39:16.840
This matter

39:17.150 --> 39:18.360
is very important.

39:19.480 --> 39:22.360
I am really afraid this shrew

39:22.840 --> 39:24.480
will cause big trouble.

39:24.800 --> 39:26.480
How about this?

39:26.710 --> 39:28.440
I'll go pacify her a bit.

39:33.230 --> 39:35.590
And I'll come see you another day.
